   - \(E_x = 30 \times 2 \times \sin \left[2 \pi\left(5 \times 10^{14} t - \frac{10^{7}}{3} z\right)\right] \mathrm{Vm}^{-1}\)
   - \(E_y = 30 \times 1 \times \sin \left[2 \pi\left(5 \times 10^{14} t - \frac{10^{7}}{3} z\right)\right] \mathrm{Vm}^{-1}\)

